{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 09/09/2024 the proposal as shown on the drawing(s) submitted on 09/09/2024 and numbered Proposed GA Rev A and Proposed Site Plan, Location Plan was not lawful within the meanings of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 because:  \r\nThe development fails to comply with the terms of Class E, Clause E.1(e)(ii) of Part 1 of Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) because the height of the building would exceed 2.5 metres and would be within 2 metres of a boundary.\r\n"
